    lessonTitle: "10 · Basketball, hockey and baseball",
    text: "Dachman, J. (2023, March 9). *NBA taps Sony's Hawk-Eye for data-tracking beginning with 2023-24 season*. Sports Video Group. Retrieved October 26, 2026, from https://www.sportsvideo.org/2023/03/09/nba-taps-sonys-hawk-eye-for-data-tracking-beginning-with-2023-24-season/ Locator: paragraph 1; paragraphs 7 and 8; section \"Second Spectrum Stays in the Mix\".",
