    excerpt: "Basketball: link, then add. CREW-05 lesson \"4 · Beside the network: replay, tracking and referee comms\" teaches the NBA Replay Center, Rule 13's review triggers and the arena tracking counts. This lesson does not repeat them. It adds three things from one trade report (Dachman, 2023):",
