    courseTitle: "The Sideline's Other Crew",
    lessonSlug: "tennis-and-football",
    lessonTitle: "11 · Tennis and football: line calling, goal-line, VAR and offside",
    text: "Hawk-Eye Innovations. (2026c, October 8). *Two decades of precision: How the ATP and Hawk-Eye elevated tennis officiating and storytelling*. Retrieved October 26, 2026, from https://www.hawkeyeinnovations.com/news/4588054/two-decades-of-precision-how-the-atp-and-hawkeye-elevated-tennis-officiating-and-storytelling Locator: \"The Dawn of Electronic Officiating\" and \"Going Live\".",
