    lessonTitle: "11 · Tennis and football: line calling, goal-line, VAR and offside",
    text: "The Football Association. (2026, January 9). *Details on VAR, semi-automated offside and goal-line technology in the 2025-26 FA Cup*. Retrieved October 26, 2026, from https://www.thefa.com/news/2026/jan/09/emirates-fa-cup-2025-26-season-var-20260901 Locator: paragraphs 3 to 5.",
