    excerpt: "Not every match gets it. In the 2025-26 FA Cup, SAOT was \"active from the fifth round onwards at all matches taking place in Premier League stadiums, due to the technology and infrastructure that it requires,\" and GLT ran from the third round at fixtures hosted by Premier League and EFL Championship clubs (The…",
